{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27917","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 七 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门巷唯苔藓，谁言不称贫。\n台闲人下晚，果熟鸟来频。\n石脉潜通井，松枝静离尘。\n残蔬得晴後，又见一番新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}